------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Forked Source In This Repository
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The components above are module dependencies, fetched at build time. Two
packages are instead forked copies that live in this tree:

pkg/ldap        Forked from github.com/nmcclain/ldap. BSD 3-Clause,
                Copyright (c) 2012 The Go Authors; see pkg/ldap/LICENSE.
                Modified for flamingo -- SASL/NTLM bind support among other
                changes; see pkg/ldap/README.md, where every change is also
                marked with a "flamingo change" comment in the source.

pkg/asn1-ber    Forked from github.com/go-asn1-ber/asn1-ber, the BER decoder
                the LDAP package depends on. BSD 3-Clause under the same Go
                Authors terms; see pkg/asn1-ber/LICENSE.

Both forks predate this work. The relay branch changed pkg/asn1-ber only to
accept zero-length BER values (an LDAP bind with an empty password was being
dropped) and pkg/ldap only to add the SASL bind path noted above.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Protocol Implementations
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SMB, LLMNR, NBT-NS, mDNS, and NTLM code in this repository was written from
Microsoft and IETF protocol specifications.

The name-poisoning listeners provide functionality comparable to Responder
(https://github.com/lgandx/Responder). No Responder source code is used or
derived from here: Responder is distributed under the GPL-3.0, which is not
compatible with this project's BSD 2-Clause license. These listeners were
implemented independently from the published wire formats of LLMNR (RFC 4795),
NBT-NS (RFC 1001/1002), and mDNS (RFC 6762). Where flag names or output
conventions resemble Responder's, that is for operator familiarity and does not
constitute use of its source.
